{% from "partials/enterprise/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{% from "partials/enterprise/icons.njk" import icon %}
{%- set faqs = [
  ["What cybersecurity services do fintech and banking institutions need?", "Financial institutions benefit from Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) and API penetration testing alongside application security testing and cloud security assessments. These services help identify vulnerabilities and protect financial data and digital transactions."],
  ["Why is cybersecurity important for fintech companies?", "Cybersecurity helps fintech companies prevent unauthorized access and reduce the risk of financial fraud while protecting sensitive customer information. Strong security controls also support business continuity and customer trust."],
  ["What is VAPT in banking cybersecurity?", "Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) identifies security weaknesses and validates their exploitability through controlled testing. Banking institutions use VAPT to evaluate risks across applications and networks alongside supporting infrastructure."],
  ["How does API penetration testing help banking institutions?", "API penetration testing identifies authentication weaknesses and broken authorization controls alongside insecure endpoints and excessive data exposure. It helps financial institutions reduce the risk of unauthorized account access and compromised transaction workflows."],
  ["Can CipherTrivia perform mobile banking application security testing?", "Yes. Mobile banking application security testing evaluates Android and iOS applications for insecure data storage and authentication flaws alongside session management weaknesses and insecure communication that could expose financial information."],
  ["How can fintech companies secure payment gateways?", "Fintech companies can strengthen payment security through regular security testing and reviews of transaction workflows alongside API integrations and access controls. Payment gateway security testing helps identify vulnerabilities that could expose payment data or allow unauthorized transaction activity."],
  ["Which compliance frameworks are relevant to banking and fintech cybersecurity?", "Relevant frameworks and requirements may include PCI DSS, ISO 27001, SOC 2, GDPR and applicable RBI cybersecurity requirements. SWIFT security controls may also apply to participating financial institutions. Applicability depends on the organization's services and regulatory obligations."],
  ["How often should banks and fintech companies conduct security testing?", "Security testing should follow a defined schedule based on risk and regulatory requirements. Additional assessments are advisable after significant application changes and infrastructure updates or when newly discovered vulnerabilities affect critical systems."],
  ["Can cloud security assessments help protect financial data?", "Yes. Cloud security assessments identify misconfigurations and excessive permissions alongside exposed storage resources and weaknesses in identity controls. These findings help organizations reduce unauthorized access risks across cloud-hosted financial applications."],
  ["What does a fintech cybersecurity assessment report include?", "A cybersecurity assessment report typically documents identified vulnerabilities and their severity alongside technical evidence and remediation recommendations. Retesting can also verify that reported issues have been resolved when included in the agreed scope."],
  ["Does cybersecurity testing help with PCI DSS compliance?", "Yes. PCI DSS-focused security testing can identify vulnerabilities in payment systems and cardholder data environments that require remediation. However, penetration testing alone does not establish PCI DSS compliance or replace required validation activities."],
  ["How can fintech and banking institutions get started with CipherTrivia?", "Financial institutions can contact CipherTrivia to discuss their technology stack and security objectives alongside applicable compliance requirements. Based on the agreed scope, we can recommend relevant cybersecurity testing services and define the assessment process."]
] %}
{#- Challenges: icon + its node position on the attack-surface map (clockwise from top left;
    ten nodes sit three along the top and bottom, two down each side) -#}
{%- set challenges = [
  ["card", "12%", "12%", 48, 48, "Payment Fraud and Transaction Manipulation", "Payment gateways and digital transaction systems can be targeted through unauthorized transaction attempts and weaknesses in transaction validation. Security testing helps identify vulnerabilities that could expose payment workflows to manipulation or fraudulent activity."],
  ["api", "50%", "12%", 200, 48, "API Security Vulnerabilities", "Banking and fintech platforms rely on APIs to connect mobile applications and payment services alongside third-party financial systems. Weak authentication and broken authorization controls can expose sensitive financial information or allow unauthorized access to account operations."],
  ["identity", "88%", "12%", 352, 48, "Account Takeover and Identity Theft", "Weak authentication mechanisms and session management flaws can allow attackers to gain unauthorized access to customer accounts. Application security testing helps identify weaknesses in login workflows and access controls that could increase the risk of account compromise."],
  ["database", "88%", "37.25%", 352, 149, "Data Breaches and Sensitive Financial Information Exposure", "Financial applications process personal information and confidential transaction records that require strong security controls. Misconfigured databases and inadequate access restrictions can expose sensitive data and create risks involving financial fraud and privacy violations."],
  ["mobile", "88%", "62.75%", 352, 251, "Mobile and Internet Banking Security Risks", "Mobile banking applications and internet banking portals may contain vulnerabilities involving insecure data storage and session handling alongside authentication weaknesses. Mobile application penetration testing and web application security assessments help identify flaws that could compromise customer accounts and financial operations."],
  ["cloud-alert", "88%", "88%", 352, 352, "Cloud Security Misconfigurations", "Fintech companies increasingly rely on cloud infrastructure to host financial applications and store operational data. Excessive permissions and exposed storage resources alongside insecure configurations can create opportunities for unauthorized access and data exposure."],
  ["dependency", "50%", "88%", 200, 352, "Third-Party and Supply Chain Risks", "Financial institutions integrate external payment providers and identity verification services alongside software libraries and fintech partners. Vulnerabilities in these connected systems can introduce security risks that affect application integrity and sensitive financial workflows."],
  ["clipboard", "12%", "88%", 48, 352, "Regulatory Compliance and Security Control Gaps", "Financial organizations must address applicable security and data protection obligations while maintaining effective technical controls. Gaps in vulnerability management and access control practices can increase compliance risks and make it harder to demonstrate appropriate security safeguards."],
  ["shield-crack", "12%", "62.75%", 48, 251, "Ransomware and Service Disruption", "Ransomware and other disruptive attacks can affect banking applications and financial infrastructure while interrupting customer access to essential services. Network security testing and vulnerability assessments help identify weaknesses that could expose critical systems to compromise."],
  ["escalate", "12%", "37.25%", 48, 149, "Insider Threats and Privilege Escalation", "Excessive user permissions and inadequate separation of duties can allow legitimate accounts to access sensitive systems beyond their intended responsibilities. Security assessments help identify privilege escalation paths and weaknesses in access control mechanisms."]
] %}
{#- Services: icon, matching service page (empty when there is no dedicated page), title, text -#}
{%- set services = [
  ["browser", "/services/web-application-security-testing/", "Application Security Testing", "Identify vulnerabilities across internet banking portals and fintech applications through application security testing. We evaluate authentication mechanisms and access controls alongside business logic to uncover weaknesses that could expose sensitive financial information."],
  ["api", "/services/api-security-testing/", "Banking and Fintech API Penetration Testing", "Assess API security through API penetration testing that examines authentication and authorization controls alongside insecure endpoints and excessive data exposure. We help identify weaknesses that could compromise financial data or unauthorized transaction workflows."],
  ["target", "/services/vapt-security-services/", "Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT)", "Discover and validate security weaknesses through Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) across applications and supporting infrastructure. We prioritize findings based on severity and exploitability while providing actionable remediation guidance."],
  ["mobile", "/services/mobile-application-security-testing/", "Mobile Banking Application Security Testing", "Evaluate Android and iOS banking applications for insecure data storage and weak authentication alongside session management flaws and insecure communication. Our mobile application penetration testing helps identify risks that could expose customer accounts or financial information."],
  ["card", "", "Payment Gateway Security Testing", "Examine payment processing workflows and transaction integrations to identify vulnerabilities in transaction validation and authorization alongside sensitive data handling. Payment gateway security testing helps uncover weaknesses that could expose financial operations to unauthorized activity."],
  ["cloud-lock", "/services/cloud-security-services/", "Cloud Security Assessment", "We also assess cloud-hosted financial applications and infrastructure to identify misconfigurations and excessive permissions alongside exposed storage resources. Our cloud security assessment services help organizations strengthen access controls and reduce the risk of data exposure."],
  ["network", "/services/network-security-testing/", "Network Security Testing", "Evaluate network infrastructure and exposed services to identify vulnerabilities that could compromise critical financial systems. Network security testing examines configurations and access restrictions to help reduce opportunities for unauthorized access."],
  ["code", "", "Secure Code Review", "Review application source code to uncover weaknesses in input validation and authentication alongside authorization controls and sensitive data processing. Secure code review services help development teams address vulnerabilities before they reach production environments."],
  ["sliders", "", "Security Configuration Assessment", "Examine security configurations and protective controls to identify gaps in application filtering and access restrictions. We assess existing configurations to help financial institutions improve their security posture and reduce unnecessary exposure."],
  ["doc-check", "/services/security-compliance/", "Compliance-Focused Security Testing", "Support broader compliance initiatives through cybersecurity assessments aligned with PCI DSS and applicable financial sector requirements. We identify technical security gaps and provide remediation guidance that helps organizations strengthen vulnerability management and security controls."],
  ["agent", "/ai-security/", "AI and Financial Technology Security Testing", "We also evaluate AI-powered financial applications and automated workflows for prompt injection and insecure tool access alongside excessive permissions and sensitive data exposure. AI security testing helps fintech companies identify emerging attack surfaces as they introduce AI-driven financial services."]
] %}

