<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s2-title">Cybersecurity Challenges Faced by Technology &amp; SaaS Companies</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Financial institutions face increasingly complex cyber threats as digital banking and online payments become central to financial services. Attackers target banking applications and payment infrastructure alongside customer accounts and financial data, making cybersecurity for fintech and banking institutions critical for protecting transactions and maintaining customer trust.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="surface" data-surface>
      <div class="surface__map" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="surface__stage">
          <span class="surface__sweep"></span>
          <svg class="surface__lines" viewBox="0 0 400 400" focusable="false">
